 "note": "Fusion gifts and their recipes. Recipes: combineFixed (any one of a gift's `recipes` fuses it; each is a list of the required gift ids; `specific` marks a gift whose recipe uses a theme pack's exclusive gift, `packs` is the union of the theme pack ids of those gifts (one recipe can need several packs), from isSpecific and the packs' specificEgoGiftPool) and combineMixed (`groups`: take `need` of each group's `ids`) of the game client 1.117.0's mirror-dungeon-common-data-md8. Ids, tiers, keywords and English names: the same client's ego-gift static data and EN_EGOgift localization. `materials` are the recipe ingredients gift_search.json does not list. Icons: image/GiftRecipe/<id>.png, the game's EgoGiftIcon sprites (by the ego-gift iconId) scaled by 0.21 with transparency filled green. `extra_gifts` (#332) are the rest of the client's gift ids 9000-9999 (static data ego-gift*, 465 in 1.117.0, 464 with a name: 9247 has neither a name nor an icon sprite, so it is left out): no shop sells them and no recipe uses them, so a shop cell may still show one (some are the theme packs' specificEgoGiftPool gifts); the Gift Search icons and the GUI ignore them, the shop cell match (agent/gift_cells.py) takes them as candidates. Chinese names: the Localize Limbus Company release's LLC_zh-CN/EGOgift_*.json by gift id (Simplified Chinese), converted with OpenCC s2twp, then 指標->指針, 重新整理->刷新, 映象->鏡像, 透過階層->通過階層, 松肉->鬆肉. Chinese names licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see NOTICE.md). Written by tools/gift_recipes.py.",
